{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "flag-impact",
  "title": "Flag Impact",
  "description": "What the simulate-delay-ms and simulate-error flags do to GET /test/error: latency, failure rate, served variants and failing traces, driven by the k6-error load generator.",
  "tags": [
    "openfeature",
    "feature-flags",
    "lgtm"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "metrics_ds",
        "label": "Metrics datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "traces_ds",
        "label": "Traces datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "tempo",
        "current": {
          "text": "Tempo",
          "value": "Tempo"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h",
      "2h",
      "1d"
    ]
  },
  "weekStart": "",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What a flag change does to a running endpoint.** `GET /test/error` on the API service evaluates two flags on every request: **`simulate-delay-ms`** (variants `none` 0 ms · `fast` 200 ms · `slow` 1 s · `very-slow` 3 s · `extremely-slow` 10 s) adds artificial latency, and **`simulate-error`** (`none` / `error`) makes the request fail with HTTP 500. Latency and status codes come from the ASP.NET Core request-duration histogram, the served variants from the OpenFeature `MetricsHook`, and the failing requests from Tempo.\n\n**Try it:** start the `k6-error` load generator in the Aspire dashboard (10 req/s), then edit `src/Garage.AppHost/flags/flagd.json`: set the `defaultVariant` of `simulate-delay-ms` to `slow` and watch latency jump, set `simulate-error` to `error` and watch the failure rate and the error traces appear — then roll both back. Hover the ⓘ icon on any panel for how it is computed."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests",
      "description": "Requests per second hitting `GET /test/error`, from the ASP.NET Core `http.server.request.duration` histogram count. With the `k6-error` load generator running this sits at ~10/s; 0 means nothing is calling the endpoint.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Requests/s"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failure Rate",
      "description": "Share of `/test/error` requests answered with an HTTP 5xx over the rate interval. The endpoint only fails when the `simulate-error` flag resolves to `error`, so this is effectively the share of users currently targeted by that variant: 100% with `defaultVariant: error`, 0% with `none`, and in between with a fractional rollout.\n\nColours: green < 1%, orange < 5%, red otherwise.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "5xx share"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Average Latency",
      "description": "Mean server-side duration of `/test/error` requests: histogram sum ÷ count over the rate interval. The endpoint sleeps for the value of `simulate-delay-ms` before answering, so the average tracks the variant mix: ~0 ms for `none`, 200 ms for `fast`, 1 s for `slow`, 3 s for `very-slow`, 10 s for `extremely-slow`.\n\nColours: green < 200 ms, yellow < 1 s, orange < 3 s, red otherwise.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_sum{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Average"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 Latency",
      "description": "95th percentile of `/test/error` request duration, estimated from the histogram buckets with `histogram_quantile`. When a fractional rollout sends only some users to a slow variant the average barely moves while the p95 exposes it — the usual way a bad flag rollout shows up in production.\n\nSame colour thresholds as the average.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency of GET /test/error",
      "description": "Average, median and 95th percentile request duration over time. Dashed lines mark the `simulate-delay-ms` variants (200 ms, 1 s, 3 s). A step in all three lines means the default variant changed; a p95 that rises while the average stays low means only part of the traffic was slowed down by targeting.\n\nPercentiles are interpolated within histogram buckets, so they are estimates.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_sum{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "average"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by(le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by(le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "average"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p50"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by Status Code",
      "description": "`/test/error` requests per second by HTTP status code, stacked so the top of the stack is the total request rate. Green is HTTP 200, red is HTTP 500 raised when `simulate-error` resolves to `error`. Because the load generator keeps a constant rate, flipping the flag swaps the colours without changing the height.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route=\"/test/error\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "HTTP 200"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "HTTP 500"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "simulate-delay-ms: Served Variants",
      "description": "Which `simulate-delay-ms` variant each request received, as successful evaluations per second per variant (`feature_flag_evaluation_success_total`). This is the cause behind the latency panels: the variant that carries the traffic here determines the delay you see there. Colours go from green (`none`) to dark red (`extremely-slow`).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(feature_flag_result_variant) (rate(feature_flag_evaluation_success_total{feature_flag_key=\"simulate-delay-ms\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature_flag_result_variant}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "none"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "fast"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "slow"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "very-slow"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "extremely-slow"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "dark-red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
