      "title": "simulate-error: Served Variants",
      "description": "Which `simulate-error` variant each request received, as successful evaluations per second per variant. `error` (red) traffic becomes HTTP 500s in *Requests by Status Code* and error traces below; `none` (green) succeeds. Note that the flag *evaluation* itself succeeds even when the variant makes the request fail.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "datasource": "$metrics_ds",
      "targets": [
        {
